about Credit","value":"the-hard-truth-about-credit","line":15,"column":0,"depth":2},"two-sides-of-the-stolen-idea-problem":{"type":"header","text":"Two Sides of the \"Stolen Idea\" Problem","value":"two-sides-of-the-stolen-idea-problem","line":20,"column":0,"depth":2},"strategies-for-building-ownership":{"type":"header","text":"Strategies for Building Ownership","value":"strategies-for-building-ownership","line":25,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"u1havyu59zlg0mifz4t09mo","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"idea-ownership-and-public-contribution\">Idea Ownership and Public Contribution<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#idea-ownership-and-public-contribution\"></a></h1>\n<h1 id=\"idea-ownership-and-public-contribution-1\">Idea Ownership and Public Contribution<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#idea-ownership-and-public-contribution-1\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"the-hard-truth-about-credit\">The Hard Truth about Credit<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#the-hard-truth-about-credit\"></a></h2>\n<p>Dunia seringkali tidak memberikan kredit kepada orang yang \"paling dulu berpikir\", melainkan kepada orang yang <strong>berani mengartikulasikan, memaketkan, dan mempertanggungjawabkan ide di ruang publik</strong>.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Atomic Idea</strong>: Ide yang hanya hidup di tongkrongan belum menjadi kontribusi publik.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"two-sides-of-the-stolen-idea-problem\">Two Sides of the \"Stolen Idea\" Problem<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#two-sides-of-the-stolen-idea-problem\"></a></h2>\n<p>Ketika ide kita dibawa orang lain ke forum besar dan mereka mendapat kredit, ada dua hal yang terjadi:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Problem Boundary/Ownership</strong>: Wajar merasa kesal jika kontribusi tidak diakui. Ini adalah kebutuhan manusiawi akan apresiasi.</li>\n<li><strong>Problem Agency</strong>: Kegagalan dalam membawa ide dari ruang aman ke ruang berisiko.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"strategies-for-building-ownership\">Strategies for Building Ownership<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#strategies-for-building-ownership\"></a></h2>\n<p>Untuk menghindari \"kehilangan\" ide dan membangun reputasi, gunakan sistem dokumentasi:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Timestamping</strong>: Tulis ide di note, thread, atau pesan grup.</li>\n<li><strong>Public Trace</strong>: Dokumentasikan insight secara bertahap di platform yang bisa dirujuk.</li>\n<li><strong>Claiming Space</strong>: Latih kalimat klaim yang tidak agresif, contoh: <em>\"Ini nyambung sama poin yang kemarin sempat saya bahas soal X, saya tambahkan sedikit ya...\"</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.boundary-vs-reality-check\">Boundary vs Reality Check</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">productivity (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">communication (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ownership (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"da